 "registered_clause_status": "E0089 is falsified if 'the loops cannot complete above 5.0'. Under the registered method (48 CPU-hour cap per step), the f* 0.57 and f* 0.33 loops have ended at Gamma 4.6 and cannot complete above 5.0: that half of the hypothesis has failed at two of eight frequencies. The other half (cost peaks near 4.6 and is back within a factor 2 of the 4.3 level by 5.0) is untested: nothing above 4.6 has run.",
